C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360785 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360786 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360787 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360788 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360789 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1041 "selection" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360785 13194139535678 true] [17592186360784 1110 #uuid "5da77b03-8105-535f-af40-d35df51c9647" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360785 1034 "-{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360785 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360785 1111 #uuid "90fc1fbc-c280-5894-9e46-b3ff4d018189" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360786 1034 "-{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360786 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360786 1111 #uuid "f15fc8a4-499b-5df5-b3db-feea0aab19cb" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360787 1034 "{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360787 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360787 1111 #uuid "bee3a55c-683f-58e8-a571-64f541ee050b" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360788 1034 "{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360788 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360788 1111 #uuid "0f06d9b8-f9b1-56ea-a95b-999bab3d5f65" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360789 1034 "-{\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360789 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360789 1111 #uuid "c914423a-6e9a-5baa-8011-ebf492f74f5e" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360790 1017 #edb/ref 17592186360791 13194139535678 true] [17592186360790 1089 "q-77182" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360790 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535678 true] [17592186360790 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069302/assets/6087da076e65bda5240c428ff67c570ad59ae9a8e5a5a3c9e8406184998de56a.png)\n\nThe path ${C}_{1}$ consists of a the line segment from the point $O(0,0)$ to the point $A(1,0),$ and the path ${C}_{2}$ consists of a line segment from the point $A(1,0)$ to the point $B(0,-2).$\n\nGiven that ${\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=\\frac{7}{3},$ evaluate ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r,$ where $F(x,y)=({x}^{2}+y)\\,i+(x-{y}^{2})\\,j,$ and $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360790 1113 #uuid "223216ba-852e-5d29-a251-0152d4edcfb4" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360790 1145 "We will use the fact that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r.\n$$\n\nWe're given the value of the second integral, so we only need to work out the first.\n\nThe path ${C}_{1}$ is the horizontal line segment from $O$ to $A.$ It can be parametrized as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{1}(t) & =0+t(a-0) \\\\  & =⟨0,0⟩+t(⟨1,0⟩-⟨0,0⟩) \\\\  & =⟨t,0⟩ \\\\  & =t\\,i,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $0<t<1.$ Along this segment, we have $x=t$ and $y=0.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{1}(t)) & =({x}^{2}+y)\\,i+(x-{y}^{2})\\,j \\\\  & =({t}^{2}+0)\\,i+(t-{0}^{2})\\,j \\\\  & ={t}^{2}\\,i+t\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the derivative, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{1}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(0)j \\\\  & =i\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now compute the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{1}(t))\\cdot {r}_{1}^{′}(t) & =({t}^{2}\\,i+t\\,j)\\cdot (i) \\\\  & ={t}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can evaluate the integral, as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}F({r}_{1}(t))\\cdot {r}_{1}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t+\\frac{7}{3} \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t+\\frac{7}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}\\,{|}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{7}{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{3}-0)+\\frac{7}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{7}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360792 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360793 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360794 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360795 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360796 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1041 "selection" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360793 13194139535678 true] [17592186360791 1110 #uuid "d5c3e3f2-885c-54e8-a2d6-677ac96e440b" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360792 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360792 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360792 1111 #uuid "3a01d6c1-bef2-5b92-9e56-899d4f0e493e" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360793 1034 "\\frac{8}{3}" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360793 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360793 1111 #uuid "7e1a9133-6fd1-5aec-ba42-2d93ef6bdfb5" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360794 1034 "2" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360794 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360794 1111 #uuid "e27c24c3-00e0-5c61-a7d7-30715a34d5d8" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360795 1034 "\\frac{8}{5}" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360795 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360795 1111 #uuid "c5087f29-2701-5b97-83bf-7259e855f1db" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360796 1034 "5" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360796 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360796 1111 #uuid "46ab4da4-214f-5ea2-9300-7d2c6df1ae2c" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360797 1017 #edb/ref 17592186360798 13194139535678 true] [17592186360797 1089 "q-77185" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360797 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535678 true] [17592186360797 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069302/assets/c0a4f042748ddadd824bed4ee71bca9724d7ca7dcc376a0ccf7c1353d59ec4fc.png)\n\nThe path ${C}_{1}$ consists of a line segment from the point $A(-2,2)$ to the point $B(-1,2),$ and the path ${C}_{2}$ consists of a line segment from the point $B(-1,2)$ to the point $D(-1,0).$\n\nGiven that ${\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=-\\frac{7}{2},$ evaluate ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r,$ where $F(x,y)=(x-y)\\,i+(y-x)\\,j,$ and $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360797 1113 #uuid "70aabb4e-a948-5d21-a14d-e3abdf21c8a1" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360797 1145 "We will use the fact that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r.\n$$\n\nWe're given the value of the first integral, so we only need to work out the second.\n\nThe path ${C}_{2}$ is the vertical line segment from $B$ to $D.$ It can be parametrized as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{2}(t) & =b+t(d-b) \\\\  & =⟨-1,2⟩+t(⟨-1,0⟩-⟨-1,2⟩) \\\\  & =⟨-1,2-2t⟩ \\\\  & =-\\,i+(2-2t)\\,j,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $0<t<1.$ Along this segment, we have $x=-1$ and $y=2-2t.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{2}(t)) & =(x-y)\\,i+(y-x)\\,j \\\\  & =(-1-(2-2t))\\,i+(2-2t-(-1))\\,j \\\\  & =(-3+2t)\\,i+(3-2t)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the derivative, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{2}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-1)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2-2t)j \\\\  & =-2\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now compute the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{2}(t))\\cdot {r}_{2}^{′}(t) & =((-3+2t)\\,i+(3-2t)\\,j)\\cdot (-2\\,j) \\\\  & =(3-2t)\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =4t-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can evaluate the integral, as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{2}+{\\int }_{0}^{1}F({r}_{2}(t))\\cdot {r}_{2}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{2}+{\\int }_{0}^{1}(4t-6)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{2}+[2{t}^{2}-6t]_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{2}+[2({1}^{2})-6(1)-0] \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{2}-4 \\\\  & =-\\frac{15}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360799 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360800 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360801 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360802 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360803 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1041 "selection" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360799 13194139535678 true] [17592186360798 1110 #uuid "64464526-a56e-56fc-b602-ecc6fc0103e2" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360799 1034 "-\\frac{15}{2}" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360799 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [17592186360799 1111 #uuid "3d87b00e-a677-5d78-b909-1ac1401ff81c" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360800 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535678 true] [17592186360800 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535678 true] [1759218636